[{"client_msg_id":"80048d03-41ad-4595-bfbb-f563ccd09081","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"それもありますね。msgpack でいえば denops が timeouterror をre-export しない限りそれについて知るべきではない、みたいな\nddc.vim は denops を re-export しているけど、これは多分いいやり方。","ts":"1633748101.291400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wj3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"856a2411-9b88-4d7e-b1c9-e13a19b1ab20","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"luma さんの外部モジュールのやつ改めて考えてみたのだけど、そもそも間接的に依存しているモジュールが提供しているクラスについては知るべきではないと思いますね。\n自分が開発中のモジュールが直接依存している A と、A が依存している B がある時、自分は B から何かを import することはできないので、それを指定してキャッチするべきではない。もし A がそれを想定するのであれば、A は B のアイテムを再 export するべき。かなーと思いました。","ts":"1633747094.290100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MOa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bba9066b-c009-43ec-882d-770596247dd5","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"使う機会は少なそうだけど、ほしいと思った時になかったら憤慨していると思う","ts":"1633746710.287200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cd=4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"64495ad9-4018-405f-9616-e921315e181c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"一度も欲しいと思ったことがなかった","ts":"1633746400.286700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RelN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8c9da44d-7050-4680-9d13-97d7cac98192","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"アプリケーションレベルだとあんまりだけどスクリプトならたまに使えるのではって気がしてます","ts":"1633746379.286300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DeE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ad87428e-fdcd-4473-b0bf-3e4103c4164e","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"確かに Promise.race 使ったことない","ts":"1633746340.285800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BEm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eefb1c98-e13a-4de3-81e1-e7a9c8235f81","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"シェルスクリプトレベルだとCDNから最速なやつ拾って使うとかちょくちょく使えそう","ts":"1633745910.285400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QLAdb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a79441ca-4143-4003-9ffd-4ee21ef6a1da","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"Promise.race、使い道は知ってるけどまぁあんまり使わなさそうって思ってたけどzxで結構便利なのでは？","ts":"1633745889.284900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZNAEd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8aa35cc9-244a-4430-bac3-5f0d72eee436","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"ぴーえぬぴーえむって読んでる","ts":"1633737447.283500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U01AQ5BFNLX"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NSJP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"25cea644-9ffa-43af-a470-85325a0bdf85","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"ぴんぴむ","ts":"1633717000.283000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X5gZs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e6c5e5bc-a87c-47c2-be82-eb27361c6c68","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"pnpm ってなんてよむんだろう","ts":"1633716998.282800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xd9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5f32c079-80f2-48aa-b78f-92993bae58c9","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"\u0026gt; `npm`、`yarn` では基本的に一つのパッケージは全体で一つのバージョンを使うのに対し、`pnpm` ではバージョン要求を相互にどうしても満たせない場合は、異なるバージョンを使うことができます。\nどういうことだろう。npm も相互に満たせない場合は入れ子になって別のバージョンが入るよね","ts":"1633714295.282200","thread_ts":"1633714295.282200","last_read":"1633742538.283900","subscribed":true,"reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6ks"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ad1b7d3e-8923-4b09-b290-8c85b8f0cdf6","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"はるか昔、な